  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sdia support UN secretariat for work against sexual violence in conflict through this support to establishment of the Team of Experts. Sida consider this support as a part of a larger support to the platform &quot;UN Action against Sexual Violence in Conflict&quot;. Team of Expert impelment their work in countries affected by violent conflict to enhance the inititives working agains sexual violence.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida st&#xf6;djer FN-sekretariatet f&#xf6;r arbete mot sexuellt v&#xe5;ld i konfliktsituationer genom ett st&#xf6;d till uppbyggnaden av ett  expterteam (Team of Experts). Sida anser st&#xf6;det vara en del av ett st&#xf6;rre st&#xf6;d till FNs plattform &quot;UN Action against Sexeual Violence in Conflict&quot;. Team of Experts genomf&#xf6;r verksamhet i l&#xe4;nder drabbade av konflikt f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka arbetet mot sexuellt v&#xe5;ld.</narrative>
  </description>
